    "knowledgeGaps": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "Knowledge-gap candidates: queries the swarm repeatedly searched and missed (bd-1n0np.6.4), surfaced from the query-miss audit log. Omitted when empty. Query text is redacted at the source (bd-1n0np.6.3), so each gap is identified by its opaque query hash, repeat count, and miss reasons.",
